<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Niugini reports US$3.1 mln year loss.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Niugini reports US$3.1 mln year loss.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		    loss 3.12 vs profit 1.71</p>
<p>    Net			    loss 3.12 vs profit 1.71</p>
<p>    Sales				40.19 vs  41.22</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Niugini Mining Ltd is a gold miner and is 50.4 percent owned by Battle Mountain Gold Co</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
